!src/NmsVault.Web/wwwroot/gallery/img/tech/

# tech.json and img/tech are extraction output and ARE committed: extraction needs an
# NMSE checkout, the Pages runner has none, and re-running it against the same game
# version is byte-for-byte identical, so it adds nothing to history unless the game moves.
